     "id": "ep24-map-quiz-1",
     "sourceNodeId": "n014",
     "speaker": "narrator",
     "textEn": "\"I have heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever. Was the monk alone?\"",
     "textZh": "\"我听说,凡是吃下唐僧的人就能永生。这位僧人是独自一人吗?\"",
     "audioRef": "sent_en:\"I have heard that anyone who eats the Tang Monk will live forever. Was the monk alone?\"",
     "audioStart": 72.606,
     "audioEnd": 80.06
    }
   ],
